'''Jaguero Isle''', also referred to as '''Jaguero Island''',<ref>{{Questlong|Neutral|48|Making a Statement}}</ref> is an island off the coast of [[Stranglethorn Vale]] that is populated by [[panther]]s and [[gorilla]]s. [[Princess Poobah]], a captive [[tauren]], is kept there by an enormous [[ape]] — [[King Mukla]].

Along the coast of the [[Wild Shore]], you will find [[Half-Buried Bottle]]s. One of them will contain a [[Carefully Folded Note]] which begins the questline:

* {{Questlong|Neutral|45|Message in a Bottle}}
** {{Questlong|Neutral|51+|Message in a Bottle}}

==Trivia==
*This area is a reference to ''{{wplink|King Kong}}''.

